{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30009_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b7f774b23309d281397e2310fb183a676be8651b29082fe6f59cf20259a139f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "数月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e50e5d3e8b24dabada94f49a28d5df3428ae30770b61980eab0e12258de21123",
      "text": "给FRAME的各位带来新工作了！\n而且这可是对方点名发来的直接邀约哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf57a75ba9e6ac20a8ae07651745d3e8d94146fa6c6bc3281bf723235c5dddd2",
      "text": "真的假的！指名我们……是这么回事吧。\n感觉真让人高兴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5361f964bd4556ec25589714c282f294fdb95f91863affab466ccd638afc7c3a",
      "text": "啊啊。\n那么，究竟是什么样的工作呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e815a772eadfee2fefee26812a464a0d0d39a0ff2973f584de2dcd4c0d80017f",
      "text": "是的！\n居然是……婚纱杂志的平面写真拍摄！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8512c036e08e05cef0f9e2312307a944ddbffbd10cc092d4177210d68b78359",
      "text": "婚纱杂志……？\n诚司先生，您以前看过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99c67b0c6856187be273286c266d7e0125436f0af20513524c97af495ffe1caf",
      "text": "不，没看过。\n对于我自己来说是相当陌生的杂志种类。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f4a86b0f4caca657d688bb5f435f9a76c8e96101f5fc0fa12ac0a38a2814f2f",
      "text": "让我看看……穿着礼服在教堂里\n拍摄，还有……约会风景的拍摄！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7cb6f05db8dd3018ce67ac2ae89bf9e900f13bf506614a814f7724971cce19a",
      "text": "约会！？\n我开始担心自己能不能胜任了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac15e09f1bc6422938669b142d45dbfd5bf37c94ba1ae80b2749b381a1f77e5",
      "text": "似乎并没有搭档演员，全都是个人的单独拍摄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:771aa9724ed121929ceb4031f0c8efc272c755bcc6908417552a0a3d743faa69",
      "text": "这样啊。既然如此……但是……\n……不，对方是看中我们才特地发来的邀约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53c279f7469d199f862a2aa06a5807725775bff64e21b572cb2920f593f8f412",
      "text": "嗯。为了不辜负这份期待，全力以赴吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b35d6291e46da415a5e4c2356204b78f65fbdac85b5c9ea148d051e71980708",
      "text": "英雄先生、诚司先生……\n说的也是呢！我也会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
